00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Upbeat theme music]

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.500
<v Host>Welcome back to Tech Talk. Today we're talking about web accessibility.</v>

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Guest>Accessibility means people with disabilities can perceive,
understand, navigate, and use the web.</v>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Host>Who benefits?</v>

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Guest>Around one in four adults in the U.S. has some type of disability.</v>

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Guest>But captions also help someone watching on a noisy bus.</v>

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
[Host laughs]

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Guest>Test with a keyboard and a screen reader early. It's much cheaper than fixing problems at the end.</v>

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
[Theme music returns]
